OL,3,GNEWSAClimber's horror fall helps test  
OL,4,ANHS breakthrough                       
OL,6,FA rock climber who suffered a collapsed
OL,7,Flung after a 5m fall in the Wye Valley 
OL,8,Fhas gone on to help doctors test a new 
OL,9,Ftreatment that could transform care for
OL,10,FNHS patients.                          
OL,12,FLewis Bruten, from Bristol, broke      
OL,13,Fbones, fractured vertebrae and suffered
OL,14,Fa life-threatening chest injury when a 
OL,15,Fpiece of climbing gear came loose      
OL,16,Fbeneath him.                           
OL,18,FWhile being treated at Southmead       
OL,19,FHospital, he became one of the first   
OL,20,Fpatients enrolled in a major UK trial  
OL,21,Fof a less invasive technique for       
OL,22,Ftreating collapsed lungs.              
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
